<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">X. Zhu, M. Xia, Z. Wei, W. Chen, D. Chen, and Y. Meng</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_year"> (2025)</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">The surprising effectiveness of negative reinforcement in LLM reasoning</span>.
</span>
