<section id="S1.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">E2E Pre-Training.</h5>

<div id="S1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the detailed hyperparameters for E2E pre-training in <a href="#S1.T2" title="In E2E Pre-Training. ‣ A.1.1 Driving Pre-training ‣ A.1 Training Configurations ‣ Senna-2: Aligning VLM and End-to-End Driving Policy for Consistent Decision Making and Planning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A2</span></a>.</p>
