<section id="S1.SS1.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Adapter Pre-Training.</h5>

<div id="S1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We train all parameters of the driving adapter from scratch and finetune all parameters of the E2E planner.
The detailed hyperparameters for adapter pre-training are provided in <a href="#S1.T3" title="In Adapter Pre-Training. ‣ A.1.1 Driving Pre-training ‣ A.1 Training Configurations ‣ Senna-2: Aligning VLM and End-to-End Driving Policy for Consistent Decision Making and Planning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S1.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S1.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Table A3</span>: </span><span id="S1.T3.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Training configurations for adapter pre-training.</span></figcaption>
<table id="S1.T3.7" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S1.T3.7.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T3.7.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:9.0pt;padding-right:9.0pt;"><span id="S1.T3.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Config</span></td>
<td id="S1.T3.7.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:9.0pt;padding-right:9.0pt;"><span id="S1.T3.7.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Value</span></td></tr>
